  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">· 단원: 식물과 에너지</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">· 대상: 15개정 중학교 2학년 과학</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">· 학습내용: 광합성에 영향을 미치는 요인</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #000000;\">※ 본 수업의&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #000000;\">저작재산권 전부 및 2차적 저작물 작성권, 편집 저작물 작성권은 모 기업에 양도 되었습니다.&#160;</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\"><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">※&#160;</span>수업 목적으로만 사용 가능합니다. 편집 사용 불가합니다.&#160;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\"><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">식물과 에너지 단원 수업을 준비하면서 아이들이&#160;</span><span style=\"color: #00a84b;\"><b>생태 감수성</b></span><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">을 함께 배웠으면 좋겠다고 생각했다.</span></span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444; font-family: 'Noto Serif KR';\">두 번째 이야기는 어린왕자가 장미를 위해 노력하고 고민하는 모습을 담았다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae44f005e08880b2287958da26d8179ef5f0c583\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ae44f005e08880b2287958da26d8179ef5f0c583\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/738be0a104258c983134a7f7ef160c26f48de3d1\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/738be0a104258c983134a7f7ef160c26f48de3d1\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">&lt;어린왕자&gt;에서 좋아하는 구절을 읽어주며 수업을 열었다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">&quot;우리도 친구, 가족, 주변 가까운 사람들과 관계를 맺을 때 &#39;시간&#39;을 사용해야 한다. 그 시간 속에 추억이 쌓아가며 관계는 깊어져간다고 생각한다. 우리가 함께한 시간들이 있기에 관계가 빛나는 것이 아닐까?&quot;</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\" data-ke-size=\"size26\">&#129418;<b>여우에게 고민 털어놓기(1)</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a1c16bec382ad8166d5b7c5c95a4f543a2def80\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4a1c16bec382ad8166d5b7c5c95a4f543a2def80\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eae5c004fa3f4bbd486c382c35a802a06315544a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eae5c004fa3f4bbd486c382c35a802a06315544a\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84e577cfdf5050de8654dc49ef00ad89d8b789b5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/84e577cfdf5050de8654dc49ef00ad89d8b789b5\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92c4e2512048dccdd5ad6fad9d451dadee350618\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/92c4e2512048dccdd5ad6fad9d451dadee350618\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5904912c21778817125cf2cf7798da99c5aadd2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/c5904912c21778817125cf2cf7798da99c5aadd2\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/060fb9f417ccd2b5606faa8176de36f463ce69ca\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/060fb9f417ccd2b5606faa8176de36f463ce69ca\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18fc326ba38feea8ac12d0c54128a0850158cdf6\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/18fc326ba38feea8ac12d0c54128a0850158cdf6\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef4e2b30bdc3709079adfffe4d880be63cf692c8\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/ef4e2b30bdc3709079adfffe4d880be63cf692c8\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9705660e4a85260bfc2bd35f4aa4a04dbb14e933\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9705660e4a85260bfc2bd35f4aa4a04dbb14e933\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">아이들이 시금치 실험을 처음 접했을 때 이해하기 어려워하기 때문에 실험 영상을 2개 준비했다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">1번 실험 영상은 광합성을 하는 경우 산소가 발생해서 시금치가 떠오르는 원리를 파악하기 위해서 준비했다. 이 실험영상을 이해하게 된다면 2번 메인 실험을 이해할 것이라고 기대했기 때문이다.</span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">* 1번 실험 영상</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">- 광합성 여부에 따른 산소 발생 확인 실험</span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0o7af6n17osu9kd0ewkpwi3@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv0o7af6n17osu9kd0ewkpwi3/thumbs/4.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33206609053&amp;signature=3rmQ0MeedzJp8rp%2FFGWDZnfoCdw%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv0o7af6n17osu9kd0ewkpwi3?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2MG83YWY2bjE3b3N1OWtkMGV3a3B3aTMiLCJ0aWQiOiI3NTZjOGIxYS03ODM5LTRhZDMtYmNiNy0zZTY5ZTg0NTg3M2EiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQ2MDR9.z9UPe1hmfxG03d71BWy1Nx4tlcpNwmWAWisiE9j6xUY7X02uOZnmIbUCmbNuCKMhURY3MrvB9Zda_bNjkvXu5g&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">* 2번째 실험 영상 (비상교과서 실험)</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">- 빛의 세기에 따른 광합성량 측정 실험</span></p><div class=\"figure-video\" data-ke-type=\"video\" data-video-url=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv70x95oq9cwhxlqxgpalyfmn@my?service=daum_cafe\" data-video-host=\"kakaotv\" data-video-play-service=\"daum_cafe\" data-video-width=\"712\" data-video-height=\"400\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-video-thumbnail=\"https://thumb.kakaocdn.net/dna/kamp/source/rv70x95oq9cwhxlqxgpalyfmn/thumbs/3.jpg?credential=TuMuFGKUIcirOSjFzOpncbomGFEIdZWK&amp;expires=33206609099&amp;signature=sSPCfUd6yHRAc551kkwGXKmpn%2Bk%3D\" data-ke-mobile-mobilestyle=\"widthFull\" data-video-origin-width=\"712\" data-video-origin-height=\"400\"><iframe src=\"https://kakaotv.daum.net/embed/player/cliplink/rv70x95oq9cwhxlqxgpalyfmn?service=daum_cafe&amp;f=p&amp;ptoken=eyJhbGciOiJIUzUxMiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJpZCI6InJ2NzB4OTVvcTljd2h4bHF4Z3BhbHlmbW4iLCJ0aWQiOiJiOTcyYjQ5MC0zMTBmLTRkZmQtOGI4OS0yMDA2Nzg2Y2Y4ZWEiLCJhcHBfaWQiOiJkYXVtX2NhZmUiLCJleHAiOjE3ODYxODQ2MDR9.HrEXe2DyaGaUwlsXapfusk23exVrDJ1Bb2-h1objl3h1pUB2l7yrmZgA0pLv_qdBCBBk_eaBTzHiHXTtHl2LDA&amp;autoplay=0\" width=\"712\" height=\"400\" frameborder=\"0\" scrolling=\"no\" allowfullscreen=\"\" allow=\"encrypted-media\"></iframe><div class=\"figcaption\"></div></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b0f4a6e3b291f7ef17896bf36a54d66c8a01cac\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5b0f4a6e3b291f7ef17896bf36a54d66c8a01cac\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">&#129418;</span><b>여우에게 고민 털어놓기(2)</b></span></p><p>&#160;</p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">&quot;너를 위해 나는 별을 따줄 수 있어.&quot;에서 모티브를 따왔다.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">같은 원리임에도 실험 세팅이 달라지면 어려워하는 학생들이 있다. 그래서 빛의 세기를 조절하는 방법으로 전구 수를 늘리는 것 외에도 전구와의 거리를 조절하는 방법도 있다는 것을 알려주고자 했다.</span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eaf24e5c8361c8ac323faad433ca49fbed6103bd\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/eaf24e5c8361c8ac323faad433ca49fbed6103bd\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d3d471c1d92a9efbcdc1e8a8e0b916a29943567\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2d3d471c1d92a9efbcdc1e8a8e0b916a29943567\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57d7f6da7e5a02128243c6f0364ee96910b15bf2\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/57d7f6da7e5a02128243c6f0364ee96910b15bf2\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p><span data-ke-size=\"size26\"><span style=\"color: #3d4444;\">&#129418;</span><b>여우에게 고민 털어놓기(3)</b></span></p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/747cf4e0ad6672e3465e43b65dad5382a81f154a\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/747cf4e0ad6672e3465e43b65dad5382a81f154a\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f61a59bb9cba73b89e31e7fe822393a0ca679b5\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7f61a59bb9cba73b89e31e7fe822393a0ca679b5\" data-origin-width=\"936\" data-origin-height=\"527\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/b370eda49459547732b7cae9522c7d842b65c847\" class=\"txc-image\" width=\"693\" data-img-src=\"http